sieve-filter-v1
; The built-in window-v1, written in the token form: a template for word filters, and a check on the
; engine (it must judge exactly as window-v1 does, with the same dictionary).
id        window-data
version   1
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     text
symbols   lower27
describe  Could be cut from running English: whole words inside, a word's end at the left edge, a word's start at the right edge (window-v1, as a plugin).
param     dictionary  dict  default  the word list (a registered dictionary)

tokens    separator " "
edges     cut
set       word  dict:{dictionary}
end
